# Problem 9 – Find Common Elements

### Code

```python
a = {10,20,30,40}
b = {30,40,50,60}

for i in a:
    for j in b:
        if i == j:
            print(j)
```

### Output

```
30
40
```

---

# Problem 10 – Union of Two Sets

### Code

```python
a = {10,20,30}
b = {30,40,50}

print(a.union(b))
```

### Output

```
{10,20,30,40,50}
```

